cally separate." (at 20.32 215.9 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid af8f933d-629d-5a72-9cca-73e7783a3df7))(text "Prepared EELP32 N87 set: nominal 0.21 mm center-leg gap. Target AL about 747 nH; verify Lm about 12 uH after assembly." (at 20.32 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid a61f328d-1f71-5ff3-aa30-46e2418d77e6))(text "JLCPCB must confirm procurement, gap preparation and core installation. Stock ungapped halves are NOT substitutes." (at 20.32 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid e8d26567-3abe-5e90-bd53-0b8a399e80ce))(text "Functional low-voltage isolation only. Output trim, ringing, thermal performance and startup need prototype validation." (at 20.32 238.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 25850300-bcb9-5356-8264-39137b9751aa)) (embedded_fonts no))